Pokémon FireRed 3DS Korean edition changes to pret/pokefirered 037335f4c725d7c9aecdac87066f2002b4bd7e14: Korean text engine
The Korean ROM's 2-byte Hangul, particles and fonts (all under KOREAN_TEXT), the Easy Chat consonant keyboard,
printers keeping their own text colours, and preproc accepting CRLF. The Korean data itself comes from tools/korean/prepare.py.

